.TH "TODOPRO GITHUB CONNECT" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro github connect Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-github\-connect \- Connect a GitHub PAT, stored securely on...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro github connect
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Connect a GitHub PAT, stored securely on the TodoPro server.
.PP
The token is sent to the TodoPro backend and is NEVER written to local
config or credentials. Requires a Pro subscription.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-pat\fP TEXT
GitHub Personal Access Token (omit to be prompted securely)
